        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A myeloblast committed to the neutrophil lineage. This cell type is GATA-1 positive, C/EBPa-positive, AML-1-positive, c-myb-positive and has low expression of PU.1 transcription factor.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ZFA:0009018</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>neutrophilic granuloblast</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>These cells are CD11b-negative, CD15-negative, CD16-negative, CD35-negative, CD49d-positive, CD68-positive, lactotransferrin-negative, and fMLP receptor-negative. They are found in the Band 3 fraction.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>neutrophilic myeloblast</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
