        <rdfs:comment>MEPs are reportedly CD19-negative, CD34-negative, CD45RA-negative, CD110-positive, CD117-positive, and SCA1-negative and reportedly express the transcription factors GATA-1 and NF-E2.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>megakaryocyte-erythroid progenitor cell</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:seeAlso>https://cellxgene.cziscience.com/cellguide/CL_0000050</rdfs:seeAlso>
        <skos:prefLabel>megakaryocyte-erythroid progenitor cell</skos:prefLabel>
