        <owl:annotatedTarget>The dermal papilla contains functionally heterogeneous Sox2-positive subpopulations that serve as a niche for multipotent stem cells. These cells exhibit progenitor properties, generate skin-derived precursors (SKPs), and can differentiate into adipogenic and osteogenic lineages.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:21444748</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


