        <owl:annotatedTarget>A smooth muscle cell that is part of a sphincter. A sphincter is a typically circular muscle that normally maintains constriction of a natural body passage or orifice and which relaxes as required by normal physiological functioning.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>GOC:cjm</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
