            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A pigment cell derived from the neural crest. The cell contains flat light-reflecting platelets, probably of guanine, in stacks called reflecting platelets or iridisomes. The color-generating components produce a silver, gold, or iridescent color.</obo:IAO_0000115>
