        <owl:annotatedTarget>A specialized stromal cell that forms the theca layer outside the basal lamina lining the ovarian follicle, appearing during the secondary follicle stage.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>MESH:D013799</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
