        <rdfs:comment>This cell type is compatible with the HIPC Lyoplate markers for &apos;non-Th1/Th17 CD4+ T cell&apos; (see CL:0001051), but includes the additional necessary and sufficient conditions to allow classification as a T-helper 2 T cell.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>T-helper 2 cell</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:seeAlso>https://cellxgene.cziscience.com/cellguide/CL_0000546</rdfs:seeAlso>
