        <owl:annotatedTarget>Interneuron of the vertebrate retina. They integrate, modulate, and interpose a temporal domain in the visual message presented to the retinal ganglion cells, with which they synapse in the inner plexiform layer. They lack large axons.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>GOC:tfm</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
