        <obo:IAO_0000115>A promyelocyte committed to the neutrophil lineage. This cell type is GATA-1-positive, C/EBPa-positive, AML-1-positive, MPO-positive, has low expression of PU.1 transcription factor and lacks lactotransferrin expression.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>FMA:84196</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ZFA:0009257</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>neutrophilic premyelocyte</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>neutrophilic progranulocyte</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>These cells are CD11b-negative, CD15-positive, CD16-negative, CD49d-positive, CD68-positive, CD35-negative, and fMLP receptor-negative. They are found in the Band 3 fraction.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>neutrophilic promyelocyte</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
