        <obo:IAO_0000115>A neuroepithelial cells that occurs singly or in small groups, close to the outer follicular borders but within the follicular basement membrane of the thyroid. This cell expresses a form of the neural cell adhesion molecule (N-CAM) on its surface and secretes calcitonin and serotonin (5-hydroxytryptamine).</obo:IAO_0000115>
