        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An interneuron that has spider-like appearance with a small round soma, a large number (7-10) of short, smooth, or slightly beaded primary dendrites that give rise to only a few secondary branches, and a branched axon that establishes a dense axonal mesh with thin shafts.</obo:IAO_0000115>
