        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/uberon/core#human_reference_atlas"/>
        <rdfs:comment>Note that while T cells of this subset are loosely referred to &apos;cytotoxic T cells,&apos; as many other T cell types, including CD4-positive, alpha-beta T cells and gamma-delta T cells exhibit cytotoxicity in vitro and in vivo.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>CD8-positive, alpha-beta cytotoxic T cell</rdfs:label>
