        <owl:annotatedTarget>A macrophage which develops from an inflammatory monocyte and is recruited into the tissues in response to injury and infection as part of an inflammatory response. Markers include CD11b-positive, CD68-positive, and F4/80-positive.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>GOC:add</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
