        <obo:IAO_0000115>A transitional stage B cell that has the phenotype surface IgM-positive, surface IgD-postive, CD21-positive, CD23-positive, CD62L-negative, CD93-positive and is located in the splenic B follicles. This cell type has also been described as IgM-high, CD19-positive, B220-positive, AA4-positive, and CD23-positive.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>T2 B lymphocyte</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>T2 B-cell</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>T2 B-lymphocyte</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>transitional stage 2 B cell</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>T2 B cells are also reportedly CD20-positive, CD24-positive, CD38-positive, CD48-positive, CD84-positive, CD150-positive, CD244-negative, and CD352-positive.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>T2 B cell</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
