        <obo:IAO_0000115>A recently activated CD8-positive, alpha-beta T cell with the phenotype HLA-DRA-positive, CD38-positive, CD69-positive, CD62L-negative, CD127-negative, CCR7-negative, and CD25-positive.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym>activated CD8+ T cell</oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>activated CD8-positive, alpha-beta T lymphocyte, human</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
