        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/cl#cellxgene_subset"/>
        <rdfs:comment>This cell type is compatible with the HIPC Lyoplate markers for &apos;activated CD8+ T cell&apos;, but includes via logical inference from its parent additional markers known to be expressed on activated CD8+ T cells.  The inclusion of HLA-DRA in the definition restricts this definition to human activated CD8+ T cells, as activated mouse T cells do not express MHC class II.</rdfs:comment>
