        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>fraction D pre-B cell</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>Fraction D precursor B cells are also reportedly CD24-positive and sIgD-negative.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>fraction D precursor B cell</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
