        <rdfs:comment>The marker set AGER can identify the Human cell type pulmonary alveolar type 1 cell in the lung with a confidence of 0.85 (NS-Forest FBeta value).</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>pulmonary alveolar type 1 cell</rdfs:label>
