        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cell located in the outermost proliferative zone of the external germinal layer that can differentiate into astroglial cells and granule cells. This cell type is glial fibrillary acidic protein-positive and HNK1-positive.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <terms:contributor rdf:resource="https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1980-3228"/>
