        <obo:IAO_0000115>A thymocyte that has a T cell receptor consisting of a gamma chain that has as part a Vgamma3 segment, and a delta chain. This cell type is CD4-negative, CD8-negative and CD24-negative. This cell-type is found in the fetal thymus with highest numbers occurring at E17-E18.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <terms:contributor rdf:resource="https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1980-3228"/>
        <oboInOwl:creation_date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2010-10-07T02:05:46Z</oboInOwl:creation_date>
