        <rdfs:comment>NOTE: currently variable immune gene segments are not represented in the OBO Foundry. Cross-product definitions were not made as a result. Also, there are three different nomenclatures for the variable gamma segments.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>mature dendritic epithelial T cell precursor</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
