            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A venule endothelial cell that is cubodial, expresses leukocyte-specific receptors, and allows for passage of lymphocytes into bloodstream.</obo:IAO_0000115>
