        <obo:IAO_0000115>A spiral ligament fibrocyte that underlies the stria vascularis and is part of a mesenchymal gap junction network that regulates ionic homeostasis of the endolymph. In mice, expression of connexin 26 (Gjb2) and connexin 30 (Gjb6) serves as a distinguishing molecular signature.</obo:IAO_0000115>
