            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002292"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PR_000015665"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A projection neuron that has its soma located in the internal segment of the globus pallidus (GPi), in the peripheral &apos;shell&apos; region. In mice and primates, it expresses somatostatin and shows dual expression of GABAergic and glutamatergic markers, enabling co-release of GABA and glutamate (Wallace et al., 2017). It projects primarily to the lateral habenula (Parent &amp; De Bellefeuille, 1982; Wallace et al., 2017), forming the limbic/aversive output stream of the GPi.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <terms:contributor rdf:resource="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5507-2103"/>
        <oboInOwl:creation_date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2025-09-30T14:21:41Z</oboInOwl:creation_date>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>GPi shell</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/uberon/core#human_reference_atlas"/>
        <rdfs:label>internal globus pallidus shell projection neuron</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
