        <obo:IAO_0000115>A conserved retinal ganglion cell orthotype whose transcriptomic profile groups together ON parasol RGCs from primate foveal and peripheral retina with their molecularly homologous mouse α RGC subtype (ON-transient α RGC, C41) (Hahn et al., 2023; Tran et al., 2019). Reference to the transcriptomic evidence is found at: GSE237215.</obo:IAO_0000115>
