        <obo:IAO_0000115>Muscle precursor cells that delaminate from the dermomyotome after epithelial-to-mesenchymal transition (EMT) and undergo long-range migration while retaining proliferative capacity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <terms:contributor rdf:resource="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2244-7917"/>
