        <obo:IAO_0000115>An endothelial cell that is part of the peritubular capillary of the kidney. This cell is highly fenestrated and plays a vital role in the kidney&apos;s filtration process, enabling the exchange of materials between the blood and the renal tubules.</obo:IAO_0000115>
