        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>SST+ IN</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>somatostatin-expressing inhibitory interneuron</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
