        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/uberon/core#human_reference_atlas"/>
        <rdfs:comment>The marker set SST, PLCH1 can identify the Human cell type sst GABAergic interneuron in the neocortex with a confidence of 0.842367005 (NS-Forest FBeta value).</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>sst GABAergic interneuron</rdfs:label>
