        <obo:IAO_0000028>canopy lamp5 interneuron</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A Lamp5 GABAergic cortical interneuron that has extended axons in the surface of L1. Canopy Lamp5 cells resemble neurogliaform cells in having elongated horizontal axonal arbors largely confined to L1; but the dendritic arbors are wider and have fewer branches, while the axon is less tortuous and extends further from the soma</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <terms:contributor rdf:resource="https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7258-9596"/>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/cl#BDS_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label>canopy lamp5 GABAergic cortical interneuron (Mmus)</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
