        <owl:annotatedTarget>A bushy cell that receives only few large excitatory endbulb synapses from auditory nerves. Spherical bush cells give excitatory input to the lateral and medial parts of the superior olive.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:31881018</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
