        <obo:IAO_0000115>A brush border cell that is part of segment 2 (S2) of the proximal tubule epithelium, located in the renal cortex. In addition to its reabsorptive functions, it is also specialized in the secretion of organic anions and cations, including para-aminohippurate.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <terms:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2022-05-10T13:26:13Z</terms:date>
