        <obo:IAO_0000115>An epithelial, transitional cell type between basal and secretory; located in stratified, non-ciliated structures (called hillocks) with high cell turnover in epithelium. In some mammalian species, this cell type has been noted to express KRT13 and is postulated to play a role in squamous barrier function and immunomodulation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <terms:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2022-06-24T14:52:24Z</terms:date>
