        <obo:IAO_0000115>A multi-ciliated cell of the endometrial epithelium. This cell is characterized by the presence of 9+2 motile cilia on its apical surface, which facilitates the movement of mucus across the endometrial surface.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <terms:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2023-02-09T11:25:14Z</terms:date>
