        <obo:IAO_0000115>A DRD1-expressing medium spiny neuron that is part of a nucleus accumbens shell or olfactory tubercle.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <terms:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2023-06-14T13:03:50Z</terms:date>
