        <rdfs:comment>In Rhesus macaques, both nucleus accumbens shell and olfactory tubercle D1 and D2 medium spiny neuron cell types have been noted to have enriched gene expression of the following: GREB1L, ARHGAP6, and GRIA4.</rdfs:comment>
