        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/cl#cellxgene_subset"/>
        <rdfs:comment>In primates, a diffuse bipolar 2 cell makes an average of 133 ribbon synapses, 47 contacts are with OFF parasol cells and 4 contacts are with OFF midget cells.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment>The marker set ENSG00000243004, ENSG00000249803 can identify the Human cell type http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_4033028 in the retina with a confidence of 0.770513807 (NS-Forest FBeta value).</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment>The marker set TAFA4, DSCAM can identify the Human cell type http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_4033028 in the retina with a confidence of 0.886091243 (NS-Forest FBeta value).</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>diffuse bipolar 2 cell</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://celltype.info/project/544/dataset/1157"/>
    </owl:Class>
