            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A specialised endothelial cell that is part of the canal of Schlemm. This cell type shares characteristics and expresses markers of both blood and lymphatic endothelial cells (Kizhatil et al., 2014) and regulates aqueous humor outflow resistance by modulating pore formation and responding to mechanical strain (Stamer et al., 2015).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <terms:contributor rdf:resource="https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6677-8489"/>
        <terms:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2025-06-16T13:55:29Z</terms:date>
