        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A sensory neuron that has the soma located in the dorsal root ganglion and expresses the marker endothelin-1 (EDN1). Endothelin signaling in DRG neurons has been demonstrated in rat tissue.</obo:IAO_0000115>
