        <owl:annotatedTarget>A sensory neuron that has the soma located in the dorsal root ganglion and expresses the marker sodium channel protein type 11 subunit alpha (Nav1.9/SCN11A). Nav1.9 is present in approximately 26% of TrkA-positive human DRG neurons and defines a nociceptor subpopulation.</owl:annotatedTarget>
