        <obo:IAO_0000115>A sensory neuron that has the soma located in the dorsal root ganglion and expresses the marker proto-oncogene tyrosine-protein kinase receptor Ret (RET). RET is present in approximately 46% of TrkA-positive human DRG neurons and marks the non-peptidergic nociceptor population.</obo:IAO_0000115>
