        <obo:IAO_0000115>A sensory neuron that has the soma located in the dorsal root ganglion and expresses the marker protachykinin-1 (substance P). This peptidergic nociceptor subpopulation is involved in pain signaling and neurogenic inflammation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
