        <owl:annotatedTarget>A sensory neuron that has the soma located in the dorsal root ganglion and expresses the marker transient receptor potential cation channel subfamily V member 1 (TRPV1). TRPV1 is the canonical heat and capsaicin nociceptor marker and is present in approximately 54% of TrkA-positive human DRG neurons.</owl:annotatedTarget>
