        <owl:annotatedTarget>A VIP GABAergic cortical interneuron expressing vasoactive intestinal polypeptide and choline acetyltransferase in the Mmus neocortex. This interneuron releases both γ-aminobutyric acid and acetylcholine.</owl:annotatedTarget>
