        <obo:IAO_0000115>An enterocyte of the human small intestine expressing bestrophin-4 (BEST4) calcium-activated ion channels.  These enterocytes have a disinctive transcriptomic profile and are scattered through the small intestine epithelium.</obo:IAO_0000115>
