        <obo:IAO_0000115>An columnar/cuboidal epithelial cell that is part of the striated duct of salivary gland, characterized by basal striations formed by infoldings of the plasma membrane. This cell play a crucial role in modifying the electrolyte composition and concentration of saliva through active ion transport, particularly the absorption of sodium and secretion of potassium.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <terms:contributor rdf:resource="https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4389-9821"/>
        <terms:contributor rdf:resource="https://orcid.org/0009-0000-8480-9277"/>
