        <owl:annotatedTarget>A type of dopaminergic neuron located in the periventricular nucleus of the hypothalamus and projecting to the lateral septum and the median eminence. It is contributing to neuroendocrine functions, locomotion and stress regulation.</owl:annotatedTarget>
