        <owl:annotatedTarget>The marker set CHST9, LAMP5 can identify the Human cell type Lamp5 Lhx6 neuron in the neocortex with a confidence of 0.821678322 (NS-Forest FBeta value).</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://zenodo.org/records/11165918</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


