        <obo:IAO_0000028>chandelier PV interneuron (Homo sapiens)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A transcriptomically definined GABAergic interneuron of the human pallium.  These cells correspond to the classically defined pvalb chandelier neuron type. The standard transcriptomic reference data for this cell type can be found on the CellxGene census under the collection: &apos;Transcriptomic cytoarchitecture reveals principles of human neocortex organization&apos;, dataset: &apos;Supercluster: CGE-derived interneurons&apos;, Author Categories: &apos;CrossArea_subclass&apos;, clusters Chandelier.</obo:IAO_0000115>
