        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Chandelier PV (Homo sapiens)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>chandelier pvalb GABAergic interneuron (Homo sapiens)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
