        <obo:IAO_0000028>CB PLI Gly-Gaba (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A Purkinje layer interneuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Rgs6 (Mmus), Slc6a5 (Mmus), Shisa9 (Mmus), Zic1 (Mmus), Bmp6 (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Subclass:309 CB PLI Gly-Gaba.</obo:IAO_0000115>
