        <obo:IAO_0000028>CBX Purkinje Gaba (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A Purkinje cell of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Pcp2 (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Subclass:313 CBX Purkinje Gaba.</obo:IAO_0000115>
