        <obo:IAO_0000028>CB Granule Glut (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cerebellar granule cell of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Gabra6 (Mmus), Ror1 (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Subclass:314 CB Granule Glut.</obo:IAO_0000115>
