        <obo:IAO_0000028>Astro-OLF NN (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A transcriptomically defined type of astrocyte located exclusively in the olfactory areas. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Gja1 (Mmus), Hs3st3a1 (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Subclass:320 Astro-OLF NN.</obo:IAO_0000115>
