        <obo:IAO_0000028>MOL NN_4 (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A mature myelinating oligodendrocyte of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Cldn11 (Mmus), Anln (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Supertype:1184 MOL NN_4.</obo:IAO_0000115>
