        <obo:IAO_0000028>Astro-NT NN_1 Galnt15 (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A astrocyte of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Gfap (Mmus), Galnt15 (Mmus), Agt (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Astro-NT NN_1 cells by expression of Galnt15. These cells are located in the Cerebellum, brain , in or close to the regions: arbor vitae . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:5208 Astro-NT NN_1.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>5208 Astro-NT NN_1</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>Astro-NT NN_1 Galnt15 astrocyte (Mmus)</rdfs:label>
