        <obo:IAO_0000028>Astro-TE NN_3 Cxcl5 (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A astrocyte of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Gja1 (Mmus), Cxcl5 (Mmus), Ddn (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Astro-TE NN_3 cells by expression of Cxcl5, Kif5a. These cells are located in the Hippocampal region, Isocortex, Olfactory areas, brain . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:5224 Astro-TE NN_3.</obo:IAO_0000115>
