        <obo:IAO_0000028>Tanycyte NN_1 Glp1r (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A tanycyte of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of C230072F16Rik (Mmus), Glp1r (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Tanycyte NN_1 cells by expression of Glp1r. These cells are located in the Hypothalamus, brain , in or close to the regions: Anteroventral periventricular nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:5244 Tanycyte NN_1.</obo:IAO_0000115>
