        <obo:IAO_0000028>Tanycyte NN_2 Mylk3 (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A alpha1-tanycyte of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Dynlrb2 (Mmus), Mylk3 (Mmus), Sfta3-ps (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Tanycyte NN_2 cells by expression of Mylk3. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a8). These cells are located in the Hypothalamus , in or close to the regions: Periventricular hypothalamic nucleus, intermediate part . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:5245 Tanycyte NN_2.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>5245 Tanycyte NN_2</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions.</rdfs:comment>
