        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A alpha2-tanycyte of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Pdzph1 (Mmus), Wdr63 (Mmus), Dscaml1 (Mmus), P3h2 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Tanycyte NN_2 cells by expression of Dscaml1, P3h2. These cells are located in the Hypothalamus , in or close to the regions: Periventricular hypothalamic nucleus, posterior part, Arcuate hypothalamic nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:5247 Tanycyte NN_2.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
