        <obo:IAO_0000115>A committed oligodendrocyte precursor of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Gpr17 (Mmus), Bmp4 (Mmus), Zfp36l1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other COP NN_1 cells by expression of Rgcc, Plpp4. These cells are located in the Isocortex, brain . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:5272 COP NN_1.</obo:IAO_0000115>
