        <obo:IAO_0000028>MFOL NN_3 Il23a (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A myelin-forming oligodendrocyte of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of 9630013A20Rik (Mmus), Ppp1r14a (Mmus), Mroh3 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other MFOL NN_3 cells by expression of Il23a, Ppp1r14a. These cells are located in the Midbrain, Isocortex, brain . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:5283 MFOL NN_3.</obo:IAO_0000115>
