        <obo:IAO_0000028>OEC NN_1 Rasgef1c (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A olfactory ensheathing cell of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Apod (Mmus), Mybpc1 (Mmus), Rasgef1c (Mmus). It is distinguished from other OEC cells by expression of Rasgef1c. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a7). These cells are located in the brain . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:5292 OEC NN_1.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>5292 OEC NN_1</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions.</rdfs:comment>
